{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-sng-4-1","title":"Song of Solomon 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ sets forth the graces of the church. 8 He shews his love to her. 16 The church prays to be made fit for his presence.</p>\n<p>thou art fair, my. 9,10; 1:15; 2:10,14; Ps 45:11; Eze 16:14; 2Co 3:18 thou hast. 5:12; Mt 11:29; Php 2:3-5 thy hair. 5:11; 6:5,7; 7:5 appear from. or, eat of, etc. mount. Nu 32:1,40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-2","title":"Song of Solomon 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>teeth. 6:6; Jer 15:16; Joh 15:7; Col 1:4-6; 1Th 2:13; 2Pe 1:5-8 and none. Ex 23:26; De 7:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-3","title":"Song of Solomon 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>lips. 11; 5:13,16; 7:9; Ps 37:30; 45:2; 119:13; Pr 10:13,20,21; 16:21-24 Mt 12:35; Lu 4:22; 2Co 5:18-21; Eph 4:29; Col 3:16,17; 4:6 scarlet. Le 14:4,6,49-52; Nu 4:8; 19:6; Jos 2:18; Pr 31:26; Heb 9:19 thy temples. 6:7; Ge 32:10; Ezr 9:6; Eze 16:63</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-4","title":"Song of Solomon 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>neck. 1:10; 7:4; 2Sa 22:51; Eph 4:15,16; Col 2:19; 1Pe 1:5 an armoury. Ne 3:19 a thousand. 2Ch 9:15,16; 12:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-5","title":"Song of Solomon 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>two breasts. 1:13; 7:3,7; 8:1,10; Pr 5:19; Isa 66:10-12; 1Pe 2:2 feed. 2:16; 6:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-6","title":"Song of Solomon 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>day. 2:17; Mal 4:2; Lu 1:78; 2Pe 1:19; 1Jo 2:8; Re 22:16 break. Heb. breathe. the mountain. Ex 20:24; 30:8,23-26; 37:29; De 12:5,6; Ps 66:15; Isa 2:2; Mal 1:11 Lu 1:9,10; Re 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-7","title":"Song of Solomon 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>1; 5:16; Nu 24:5; Ps 45:11,13; Eph 5:25-27; Col 1:22; 2Pe 3:14 Jude 1:24; Re 21:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-8","title":"Song of Solomon 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>with me. 2:13; 7:11; Ps 45:10; Pr 9:6; Joh 12:26; Col 3:1,2 from Lebanon. De 3:25 Shenir. De 3:9; Jos 12:1 from the lions'. Ps 76:1,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-9","title":"Song of Solomon 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>ravished. or, taken away, etc. my sister. 10,12; 5:1,2; Ge 20:12; Mt 12:50; 1Co 9:5; Heb 2:11-14 my spouse. 3:11; Ps 45:9; Isa 54:5; 62:5; Eze 16:8; Ho 2:19,20; Joh 3:29 2Co 11:2; Re 19:7,8; 21:2,9,10 thou hast. 6:12; 7:5,6,10; Pr 5:19,20; Zep 3:17 with one of. 1:15; 6:5 one chain. 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-10","title":"Song of Solomon 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>love. Heb. loves. 1:2; *marg: how much. 1:2,4 the smell. 1:3,12; 3:6; 5:5; 2Co 1:21,22; Ga 5:22; Php 4:18; Re 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-11","title":"Song of Solomon 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>lips. 3; 5:13; 7:9; Ps 71:14,15,23,24; Pr 16:24; Ho 14:2; Heb 13:15 honey. 5:1; Pr 24:13,14; Isa 7:15 the smell. 10; Ge 27:27; Ps 45:8; Ho 14:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-12","title":"Song of Solomon 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>garden. 6:2,11; Pr 5:15-18; Isa 58:11; 61:10,11; Jer 31:12; Ho 6:3 1Co 6:13,19,20; 7:34; Re 21:27 inclosed. Heb. barred. sealed. 2Co 1:22; Eph 1:13; 4:30; Re 7:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-13","title":"Song of Solomon 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>are. 6:11; 7:12; 8:2; Ps 92:14; Ec 2:5; Isa 60:21; 61:11; Joh 15:1-3 Php 1:11 pleasant. 6:2 camphire. or, cypress. 14; 1:14 spikenard. 1:12; Mr 14:3; Joh 12:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-14","title":"Song of Solomon 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>calamus. Ex 30:23; Eze 27:19 cinnamon. Pr 7:17; Re 18:13 trees. 6; 5:1; Nu 24:6 the chief. 6:2; Ge 43:11; 1Ki 10:10; 2Ch 9:9; Mr 16:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-15","title":"Song of Solomon 4:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>fountain. 12; Ec 2:6 a well. Ps 36:8,9; 46:4; Jer 2:13; 17:13; Joh 4:10,14; 7:38; Re 22:1 streams. Jer 18:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-4-16","title":"Song of Solomon 4:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Awake. 1:4; Ec 1:6; Isa 51:9-11; 64:1; Eze 37:9; Joh 3:8; Ac 2:1,2; 4:31 the spices. 13,14; 7:12,13; 2Co 9:10-15; Php 1:9-11; Col 1:9-12; 1Th 2:12,13 Heb 13:20,21; 2Pe 3:18 Let. 5:1; 8:12; Mt 26:10,12; Joh 5:8; Ro 15:16,28; 1Pe 2:5,9,10</p>"}]}